sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client<br/>serving/client.py
    participant N as nginx<br/>port 8080
    participant U as MLflow scoring server<br/>uvicorn, 127.0.0.1:8000
    participant E as entry.py<br/>ServedMethodModel
    participant M as The tagging method
    C->>N: GET /ping
    N->>U: GET /ping
    U-->>C: 200 once the method has loaded (nginx answers 502 before)
    C->>N: POST /invocations, dataframe_split JSON
    N->>U: POST /invocations
    Note over U: read the frame,<br/>check it against<br/>the signature
    U->>E: predict(context, model_input)
    activate E
    Note over E,M: one lock: one prediction at a time,<br/>so one GPU forward pass at a time
    E->>M: served_records, through cli.run_method
    M-->>E: 0/1 focus tags, scores, per-tag thresholds
    deactivate E
    alt the method answered
        E-->>U: one record per problem
        U-->>C: 200, the predictions in request order
    else a CliError, e.g. two problems for an API method
        E-->>U: MlflowException, one line
        U-->>C: 500, a JSON message
    end
